          "source_text_sha256": "a40d4445623683c649a4f874776dab3124d09e4241c75c8913e49af4993f41f7",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On July 26, 2012, at 10:20 PM, a witness on their balcony was intrigued by the quick and silent passage of a dim, hazy ball in the clear sky. During the object's S-N movement, the witness noticed bright points below the object as well as several small jet trails at the rear. The observation lasted 6 seconds before the object was hidden by the house roof. No other witnesses have come forward. We are dealing with a case of a straight-line moving phenomenon, thus of average strangeness a priori, but the completely unusual aspect of the phenomenon makes it stranger. A relatively large number of hypotheses need to be considered, as the phenomenon resembles various causes (see investigation report), but none fit well. The case consistency is good, with a high-quality, very precise, well-documented testimony written by the witness immediately after the observation. However, this remains a unique testimony, without photos or videos. The GEIPAN, unable to confirm any of the considered hypotheses, classifies this case as \"D1\" as an unexplained phenomenon.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "b8c7deb0482e3cef7369c6387c0aec416e9796d8ba0b312074d58735bb89dfa0"
        }
      ],
